      "title": "原拟出嫁时被取入宫",
      "summary": "王衍取将嫁的王承纲女入宫；王承纲请求归还，父亲获罪被流放茂州。",
      "year": 922,
      "precision": "year",
      "sourceDate": "《通鉴》龙德二年夏四月；《十国春秋》乾德四年夏四月",
      "phase": "later",
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v271",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v271-p71",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "41a03f1eeebee1341733950fc2bc9803d063d784faaa0200428b60c8de90e8b2",
          "excerpt": "夏，四月，蜀軍使王承綱女將嫁，蜀主取之入宮。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "tongjian-v271",
          "paragraphId": "tongjian-v271-p71",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "41a03f1eeebee1341733950fc2bc9803d063d784faaa0200428b60c8de90e8b2",
          "excerpt": "承綱請之，蜀主怒，流於茂州。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v037",
          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v037-p5",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "fc52b14b33647960ff5527393b6a57e0ac8c5eab144c61168a8547b86be770e6",
          "excerpt": "夏四月，奪軍使王承綱女，承綱請之，帝怒，流之茂州。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "流茂州者为王承纲；不把父亲处罚当女子流放。",
        "此事件日期只取原文夏四月所在年，不把下一甲戌套作该女纪日。"
      ],
